# Scene1-2-b1

; ●シーン1‐2-b1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:100_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

[PrintTextModified Text:同意试试看。|#0102Bad01_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_26_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:机会难得，不如占卜看看……？|#0102Bad01_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵呵，就喜欢你这样的。|#0102Bad01_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到玛格面露妖艳的微笑，汉娜不禁对她投来怀疑的目光。|#0102Bad01_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:总感觉非常地可疑呢……|#0102Bad01_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，可别这么说。放心吧。<br>就像我刚才说过的那样，我的占卜真的很准啦。|#0102Bad01_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可是，你的收费很贵吧？<br>我们都没有钱……|#0102Bad01_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这个嘛……那就特别给你们首次优惠，<br>先欠着好了。<br>……不过我也不介意用身体支付哦♡|#0102Bad01_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格眯起眼睛，盯着艾玛等人。|#0102Bad01_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:用、用身体，是什么意思……？|#0102Bad01_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵，这个就任君想像了。|#0102Bad01_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:等、等等艾玛！<br>还是别占卜比较好吧！？|#0102Bad01_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜害怕地抱紧自己的身体。|#0102Bad01_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也、也是……<br>抱歉玛格，我就不占卜了……|#0102Bad01_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，现在可没法取消了哦。|#0102Bad01_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:欸？|#0102Bad01_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为我已经给你占卜了嘛。|#0102Bad01_Margo006| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格小声笑着<br>把三张塔罗牌摆在桌上。|#0102Bad01_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:三张牌分别代表过去、现在和未来。<br>首先是第一张。过去是……【塔】的正位。<br>这个结果好像和之前一样呢。|#0102Bad01_Margo007| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和雪莉看向彼此。|#0102Bad01_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; シーン1‐1‐9の回想（流用）
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:我相信不会发生凶杀案的。|#0102Bad01_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格拿出一张牌，<br>放在了艾玛和雪莉面前。|#0102Bad01_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:【塔】的正位。<br>……在不久的将来，会有某个人死去。|#0102Bad01_Margo008| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 回想ここまで
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:确实和之前是同一张牌。|#0102Bad01_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（在那之后真的发生了案件，诺亚她……<br>　我也不想相信，但她可能真的预测中了）|#0102Bad01_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:第二张牌代表着现在……【月亮】的正位。<br>这张牌的意思是……<br>对无法预知的危险和望不到头的现状而感到不安。|#0102Bad01_Margo009| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不觉得这正是现在的我们吗？|#0102Bad01_Margo010| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（好像，是这样……）|#0102Bad01_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:会不会再次发生案件。<br>谁又会杀谁，谁会被处刑。<br>毫无疑问，大家都被笼罩在这些不安当中。|#0102Bad01_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:最后一张牌代表的是未来。<br>……【恶魔】的正位。|#0102Bad01_Margo011| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只能让人联想到不好的事情。|#0102Bad01_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:见汉娜愁眉苦脸的样子，玛格点点头。|#0102Bad01_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:很遗憾，确实如此。<br>失去朋友、背叛、憎恨、嫉妒、破灭……<br>这张牌的正位有很多负面的意思。|#0102Bad01_Margo012| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:破灭……|#0102Bad01_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛一脸严肃地嘟哝道，玛格见此便耸耸肩说道。|#0102Bad01_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果让你感到不安了，先说声抱歉。<br>但这并不意味一定会迎来这样的未来。<br>也可以把它当作一种警告。|#0102Bad01_Margo013| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:根据你今后的行动，<br>或许……未来也会被改变。|#0102Bad01_Margo014| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格……嗯，你说得对！<br>谢谢你！我们会加油的！|#0102Bad01_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵，好啊……加油吧。|#0102Bad01_Margo015| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

