[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉注意到艾玛的视线，便问道。|#0102Bad01_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，你也在想那个占卜结果吗？|#0102Bad01_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

