[PrintTextModified Text:玛格的话里有着奇妙的说服力——<br>令人不禁去想她所说的可能。|#0102Bad01_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default

